You extract new named locations from a Pathfinder 1e narrative turn. Your job is
to identify genuinely new places the narrative introduced — not generic spaces,
not locations that already exist.

<% if @known_location_names.any? -%>
=== KNOWN LOCATIONS (already in the registry — do NOT re-emit) ===
<%= @known_location_names.join(", ") %>

<% end -%>
=== OUTPUT SCHEMA ===
<%= @schema_json %>

Respond ONLY with valid JSON (no markdown, no code fences):
{
  "locations": [
    {"name": "...", "description": "..."}
  ],
  "reasoning": "..."
}

If no new locations were introduced, return `{"locations": [], "reasoning": "..."}`.
